Kagent has been successfully deployed to namespace: iot-agents

ACCESSING THE UI:
  1. Forward the UI service port:
     kubectl -n iot-agents port-forward service/kagent-ui 8080:8080

  2. Open your browser and visit:
     http://localhost:8080

ACCESSING THE CONTROLLER API:
  kubectl -n iot-agents port-forward service/kagent-controller 8083:8083

  API endpoint: http://localhost:8083/api

DEPLOYED COMPONENTS:
  - Controller: kagent-controller (manages Kubernetes resources)
  - Engine: kagent-engine (AI agent runtime)
  - UI: kagent-ui (web interface)

ENABLED TOOLS:

ENABLED AGENTS:

USEFUL COMMANDS:
  # View all kagent resources
  kubectl -n iot-agents get agents,modelconfigs,toolservers,memories

  # Get agents
  kubectl -n iot-agents get agents

  # View logs
  kubectl -n iot-agents logs -l app.kubernetes.io/name=kagent -f

TROUBLESHOOTING:
  - Check pod status: kubectl -n iot-agents get pods
  - View events: kubectl -n iot-agents get events --sort-by='.lastTimestamp'
  - Controller logs: kubectl -n iot-agents logs -l app.kubernetes.io/component=controller -f
DOCUMENTATION:
  Visit https://kagent.dev for comprehensive documentation and examples.

